### Teste da Rota Raíz
GET http://localhost:3000/
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 1. Cadastrar Cliente 
POST http://localhost:3000/cliente
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Carlos",
  "email": "carlos@gmail.com",
  "senha": "abc",
  "cpf": "12345678901",
  "endereco": "Rua Lages, 123"
}

###

### 2. Listar Clientes
GET http://localhost:3000/clientes
Authorization: token
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 3. Cadastrar Console
POST http://localhost:3000/console
Authorization: token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modelo": "PlayStation 5",
  "marca": "Sony"
}

###

### 4. Cadastrar Agendamento
POST http://localhost:3000/agendamento
Authorization: token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": "2026-11-10",
  "hora": "14:30:00",
  "tipoServico": "Limpeza e troca de pasta térmica"
}